From 1e919e15db24a5b645b9fb90522c7041fa43db35 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: callanjfox <callanf@nvidia.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 19:03:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 01/38] feat(replay): placement policies can request a wake-up
 at a future replay time

A dispatch gate's hold deadline or a client retry has no engine event to wake on.
PlacementPolicy::next_wakeup_ms (default None) lets the policy name the next time it
has work to release; aggregated and disaggregated replay visit it and call
advance_clock there. The crate version matches the published
0.13.0-dev.202610290000000087 so Dynamo can [patch] it in.

